from (values
('127.230.d.8.D',3,'A lab''s acceptable use policy forbids installing personal software. A student should:','["follow the policy", "hide it", "ask a friend to do it", "install anyway"]'::jsonb,0,'Policies protect shared systems.','original'),
('127.230.d.8.D',4,'Which is good etiquette in a shared photo lab?','["Leave files on desktops", "Clean up the workstation and save files to your folder", "Change settings for everyone", "Use others'' accounts"]'::jsonb,1,'Courtesy keeps shared spaces ready.','original'),
('127.230.d.9.A',3,'A photography student keeps a printed and online portfolio of her best images. She is:','["hiding work", "avoiding feedback", "maintaining a portfolio", "wasting paper"]'::jsonb,2,'Portfolios show skills to clients.','original'),
('127.230.d.9.A',4,'What should a commercial photography portfolio show?','["Only blurry shots", "Only family snapshots", "Every photo you took", "A range of strong work targeted to the type of clients you want"]'::jsonb,3,'Curated work attracts the right clients.','original'),
('127.230.d.9.B',3,'A graduate compares job offers by pay, benefits, and growth chances. She is:','["evaluating employment opportunities", "ignoring details", "avoiding work", "picking at random"]'::jsonb,0,'Comparing supports good decisions.','original'),
('127.230.d.9.B',4,'Which factor is important when choosing between a studio job and freelance work?','["The color of the camera strap", "Income stability and benefits", "The studio''s lobby plant", "The brand of cameras only"]'::jsonb,1,'Stability affects planning.','original'),
('127.230.d.10.A',3,'Scheduling shoots, edits, and deliveries so work is finished on time is:','["procrastination", "guessing", "planning and time management", "avoidance"]'::jsonb,2,'Planning ensures deadlines are met.','original'),
('127.230.d.10.A',4,'Which approach helps a photographer meet an edit deadline?','["Skip culling", "Wait until the last day", "Edit without a plan", "Break the work into steps with daily targets"]'::jsonb,3,'Daily targets make progress steady.','original'),
('127.230.d.10.B',3,'A freelance photographer prices a job by adding time, equipment, and editing costs. She is:','["creating a quote", "ignoring costs", "guessing", "skipping work"]'::jsonb,0,'Quotes include all expenses.','original'),
('127.230.d.10.B',4,'Which cost should be included in a freelance photography quote?','["Nothing for travel", "Editing time and image delivery", "Nothing for editing", "Only the shoot time"]'::jsonb,1,'Edit time is part of the work.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.A',3,'A photographer creates images of products for a catalog. She is creating photographs for a:','["hidden purpose", "random purpose", "defined purpose", "no purpose"]'::jsonb,2,'Commercial photos have specific goals.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.A',4,'A real estate photographer shoots a house to attract buyers. Her purpose is to:','["teach cooking", "create a menu", "sell cars", "market the property"]'::jsonb,3,'The images support a sale.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.B',3,'Using line, color, and balance to improve a product photo applies the:','["elements and principles of art", "laws of aviation", "steps of plumbing", "rules of finance"]'::jsonb,0,'Art principles guide composition.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.B',4,'Placing a bright product against a muted background uses:','["lag", "contrast", "noise", "grain"]'::jsonb,1,'Contrast makes a subject stand out.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.C',3,'Working with models, props, and a set to create a commercial image applies:','["coding rules", "accounting rules", "principles of commercial photography", "carpentry"]'::jsonb,2,'Direction and styling are commercial skills.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.C',4,'What is a main job of a stylist on a product shoot?','["Develop film", "Pay the invoices", "Edit the contract", "Arrange props and details so the product looks its best"]'::jsonb,3,'Styling enhances the scene.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.D',3,'A long telephoto lens is useful for:','["compressing distance and isolating distant subjects", "shooting underwater only", "macro of tiny objects only", "wide room shots"]'::jsonb,0,'Telephoto lenses magnify far subjects.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.D',4,'Which lens is best for photographing a small piece of jewelry in detail?','["A fisheye lens", "A macro lens", "A mirror lens", "A super-wide lens"]'::jsonb,1,'Macro lenses focus close.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.E',3,'Placing the subject along the lines of a grid instead of the exact center follows the:','["rule of ten", "rule of zero", "rule of thirds", "rule of halves"]'::jsonb,2,'The rule of thirds improves composition.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.E',4,'Leaving open space in the direction a subject is looking:','["hides the subject", "blurs the photo", "wastes the frame", "gives the image balance"]'::jsonb,3,'Lead room balances the composition.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.F',3,'Converting a color image to monochrome for dramatic contrast is working in:','["digital black and white", "paper only", "negative only", "film color"]'::jsonb,0,'Black-and-white conversion emphasizes tone.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.F',4,'A photographer adjusts white balance to correct a yellow tint. She is working with:','["paper cutting", "digital color photography", "darkroom chemistry", "film loading"]'::jsonb,1,'White balance corrects color casts.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.G',4,'The main light in three-point lighting is called the:','["ambient", "kicker only", "key light", "fill light"]'::jsonb,2,'The key light provides the main illumination.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.H',3,'Sharp focus, proper exposure, and clean composition make a photograph:','["amateur", "damaged", "blurry", "professional quality"]'::jsonb,3,'Technical and aesthetic quality define professional work.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.H',4,'A client rejects images with underexposed faces. To produce professional work next time, the photographer should:','["check exposure and use fill light", "use auto everything", "ignore the histogram", "shoot faster"]'::jsonb,0,'Exposure control prevents dark faces.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.I',3,'A glossy surface that reflects light and makes colors look vivid is a:','["tripod leg", "photographic paper finish", "camera body", "lens hood"]'::jsonb,1,'Gloss is a common finish.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.I',4,'For a fine art print with a soft, non-reflective look, which paper is a good choice?','["Tracing paper", "High-gloss paper", "Matte paper", "Newsprint"]'::jsonb,2,'Matte reduces glare.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.J',3,'A border cut around a photo inside a frame is called a:','["filter", "softbox", "lens", "mat"]'::jsonb,3,'Mats separate the print from the frame.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.J',4,'Why use acid-free mat board for archival prints?','["It prevents yellowing and damage over time", "It is brighter", "It is heavier", "It is cheaper"]'::jsonb,0,'Acid-free materials protect prints.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.K',3,'Photographers who use current, industry-standard software are using:','["random tools", "appropriate production tools", "no tools", "outdated tools"]'::jsonb,1,'Using standard tools helps collaboration.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.K',4,'Which tool is an industry-standard way to edit raw images?','["A spreadsheet", "A word processor", "Professional photo-editing software", "A calculator"]'::jsonb,2,'Photo editors process raw files.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.L',3,'A photographer reviews her images against composition, lighting, and client goals. She is:','["erasing files", "guessing", "ignoring results", "evaluating photographs"]'::jsonb,3,'Evaluation uses criteria.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.L',4,'Which question helps evaluate a commercial photo?','["Does it communicate the product''s key benefit clearly?", "Is the file name long?", "Is the date recent?", "Is it big?"]'::jsonb,0,'Commercial success depends on communicating the message.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.M',3,'A web image needs a small file size, while a billboard print needs:','["no resolution", "high resolution", "low resolution", "only a thumbnail"]'::jsonb,1,'Large prints need more pixels.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.M',4,'Which file format is best for a high-quality image with layers for further editing?','["Plain text", "Low-quality JPEG only", "TIFF or PSD", "GIF only"]'::jsonb,2,'TIFF and PSD preserve quality and layers.','original'),
('127.231.d.2',3,'A photographer''s studio lights keep tripping the circuit. She checks wattage, circuits, and extension cords. This is:','["giving up", "panic", "guessing", "problem solving"]'::jsonb,3,'Systematic checks solve problems.','original'),
('127.231.d.2',4,'Which approach is best for solving an inconsistent color problem across a set of images?','["Check lighting, white balance, and monitor calibration one at a time", "Blame the camera", "Change everything", "Ignore it"]'::jsonb,0,'Isolating variables finds the cause.','original'),
('127.231.d.3',3,'A practicum student unplugs lights before moving them and wears gloves near hot lamps. These are:','["fashion choices", "safety techniques", "paper sizes", "pricing steps"]'::jsonb,1,'Safe handling prevents burns and shocks.','original'),
('127.231.d.3',4,'Which safety habit is important in a studio with many cables?','["Draping cables loosely", "Overloading outlets", "Taping cables and keeping aisles clear", "Ignoring spills"]'::jsonb,2,'Clear aisles prevent trips.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.A',3,'A student gives a model clear directions using words and hand gestures. This is:','["silent work", "guessing", "avoidance", "verbal and non-verbal communication"]'::jsonb,3,'Gestures and words guide a subject.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.A',4,'Which technique keeps a client at ease during a portrait session?','["A calm voice and friendly body language", "Silence and frowning", "Shouting orders", "Checking your phone"]'::jsonb,0,'Tone and posture affect comfort.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.B',3,'A student studies website traffic from her gallery and explains the results to a client. She is:','["guessing", "interpreting and communicating data", "ignoring numbers", "hiding results"]'::jsonb,1,'Reporting data informs decisions.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.B',4,'Which statement communicates analytics clearly?','["It seemed busier.", "More people came maybe.", "Visits increased from 300 to 450 after the new gallery launched.", "Things changed."]'::jsonb,2,'Specific numbers are clear.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.C',3,'A student presents her portfolio to a panel with slides and Q&A. This is:','["a private note", "a sound test", "a lens check", "a formal presentation"]'::jsonb,3,'Planned slides and questions are formal.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.C',4,'Which helps a portfolio presentation succeed?','["Practicing the order and keeping explanations brief", "Using tiny text", "Reading every word", "Skipping the best images"]'::jsonb,0,'Preparation and brevity keep interest.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.D',3,'Taking notes while a client explains their needs and then repeating them back is:','["interrupting", "active listening", "daydreaming", "ignoring"]'::jsonb,1,'Repeating confirms understanding.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.D',4,'A client''s feedback is unclear. The photographer should:','["ignore it", "guess", "ask questions to clarify the request", "redo everything"]'::jsonb,2,'Questions clarify requirements.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.E',3,'Sending a polite thank-you and a preview gallery within a day builds:','["delay", "tension", "mistrust", "customer relations"]'::jsonb,3,'Prompt, polite service builds loyalty.','original'),
('127.231.d.1.E',4,'A client wants a refund because she disliked her photos. A good public-relations response is to:','["listen, apologize, and propose a fix", "post complaints", "argue", "ignore"]'::jsonb,0,'Calm responses can retain clients.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.A',3,'A practicum student arrives early, helps carry gear, and finishes edits on time. She shows:','["a bad habit", "a positive work ethic", "shortcuts", "delay"]'::jsonb,1,'Reliability is work ethic.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.A',4,'Which behavior shows a productive work ethic during a long event shoot?','["Leaving gear on the floor", "Skipping shots", "Staying focused and keeping equipment organized", "Wandering away"]'::jsonb,2,'Organization and focus matter.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.B',3,'A photographer gets permission before using a client''s photos in her advertising. This is:','["carelessness", "gossip", "greed", "ethical conduct with others"]'::jsonb,3,'Permission respects the client.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.B',4,'A client asks the photographer not to share her family photos. The photographer should:','["respect the request", "sell them", "post them anyway", "mention it publicly"]'::jsonb,0,'Respecting privacy is ethical.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.C',3,'Following all shop rules, laws, and regulations should be done:','["never", "every day", "only when watched", "occasionally"]'::jsonb,1,'Compliance is continuous.','original'),
('127.231.d.4.C',4,'Which example shows compliance in a studio?','["Skipping releases", "Posting without consent", "Keeping signed releases on file for each model", "Ignoring fire exits"]'::jsonb,2,'Releases are legal protection.','original')
