('127.231.d.5.B',3,'Choosing a prime lens for a portrait and a zoom for a fast event shows increased skill in:','["cooking", "using cameras and lenses", "carpentry", "accounting"]'::jsonb,1,'Lens choice affects results.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.B',4,'Which lens would best capture a portrait with a soft blurred background?','["A slow lens at its smallest aperture", "A pinhole", "A fast lens with a wide aperture", "A fisheye lens"]'::jsonb,2,'Wide apertures create shallow depth of field.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.C',3,'Arranging a product so its lines draw the eye through the frame uses:','["printing registration", "audio mixing", "tax rules", "composition and layout principles"]'::jsonb,3,'Composition guides attention.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.C',4,'In a catalog layout, leaving blank space around a product helps:','["text and image fit cleanly", "distort the image", "remove color", "hide the product"]'::jsonb,0,'Space gives room for copy.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.D',3,'Lighting a subject with a key light, fill light, and hair light is:','["no lighting", "three-point lighting", "flat lighting", "single-point"]'::jsonb,1,'Three lights shape the subject.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.D',4,'A softbox is used to:','["darken the room", "harden shadows", "soften and diffuse a light source", "block all light"]'::jsonb,2,'Softboxes make light gentle.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.E',3,'Delivering sharp, well-exposed, properly composed images to a client is producing:','["amateur work", "blurry shots", "random snapshots", "professional-quality photographs"]'::jsonb,3,'Quality meets client standards.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.E',4,'Which step helps ensure professional quality before delivery?','["Review each image for focus, exposure, and color", "Deliver all raw shots unedited", "Skip culling", "Skip color check"]'::jsonb,0,'Quality control matters.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.F',3,'A photographer prints a fine art series on archival paper chosen for its texture. She is selecting the:','["cheapest option always", "appropriate photographic paper", "random paper", "wrong tool"]'::jsonb,1,'Paper affects the look and longevity.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.F',4,'Which paper suits an image with deep, rich blacks and high contrast?','["Tracing paper", "Newsprint", "A glossy or luster paper", "Rough sketch paper"]'::jsonb,2,'Glossy papers support dense blacks.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.G',3,'Placing a print inside a frame with a border is:','["retouching", "filtering", "scanning", "matting and framing"]'::jsonb,3,'Mats and frames protect prints.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.G',4,'Why choose UV-protective glass for framing a valuable print?','["It reduces fading from light", "It reduces cost", "It changes colors", "It adds weight"]'::jsonb,0,'UV glass protects prints.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.H',3,'A photographer follows industry standards when editing and exporting files. She is using:','["outdated methods", "industry-standard production tools", "random methods", "no methods"]'::jsonb,1,'Standards keep work compatible.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.H',4,'Which tool is used to batch-process raw images for color and exposure?','["A word processor", "A calculator", "A raw editor with presets", "A spreadsheet"]'::jsonb,2,'Presets speed consistent edits.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.I',3,'Exporting a web gallery image at lower resolution but a print file at full resolution shows understanding of:','["budgeting", "music", "fashion", "resolution and file formats"]'::jsonb,3,'Different uses need different settings.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.I',4,'Which format is suitable for a web photograph with small file size?','["JPEG", "TIFF only", "PSD only", "RAW"]'::jsonb,0,'JPEG is compressed for web use.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.J',3,'A student now meters light faster and with fewer errors than at the start. This shows:','["decline", "growth of technical skills", "lost skills", "no change"]'::jsonb,1,'Speed and accuracy show growth.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.J',4,'Which evidence shows growth in a photographer''s skills?','["Skipping reviews", "Deleting old files", "Comparing earlier and later images", "Ignoring earlier work"]'::jsonb,2,'Comparison reveals progress.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.K',3,'A student lists the techniques she handles well and those she still needs to improve. She is evaluating her:','["salary", "hobbies", "address", "strengths and weaknesses"]'::jsonb,3,'Self-evaluation guides improvement.','original'),
('127.231.d.5.K',4,'Why evaluate your own proficiency during a practicum?','["To set goals for improvement", "To feel discouraged", "To avoid work", "To hide problems"]'::jsonb,0,'Honest evaluation drives growth.','original'),
