('127.228.d.7.E',5,'A designer wants to reuse a Creative Commons-licensed illustration on a printed menu she will sell. Which license element must she check before printing?','["The press speed", "The ink brand", "The paper weight", "Whether the license allows commercial use"]'::jsonb,3,'Some licenses prohibit commercial use.','original'),
('127.230.d.11.G',5,'A portrait looks flat because only one front light was used. Which lighting change adds depth and separates the subject from the background?','["Adding a fill light and a back light to the key light", "Using a wider lens", "Moving the camera closer", "Turning off all lights"]'::jsonb,0,'Three-point lighting shapes and separates the subject.','original'),
('127.230.d.2.E',4,'A client says, ''I want it to feel warm.'' What is the best listening response?','["Say nothing", "Ask what warm means to her, such as colors, mood, or setting", "Change the subject", "Assume you know and begin"]'::jsonb,1,'Clarifying questions turn vague feedback into usable direction.','original')
